<!--
    Overlay on Playnite Default/Media.xaml.
    Icon set: Fluent UI System Icons (@fluentui/svg-icons 1.1.342, MIT, info/LICENSE-fluentui-system-icons.txt), the
    set Fluent UI React v9 draws through react-icons. Regular 20px for buttons and navigation, Filled 16px for the
    checkmark (Menu and Option). Path data is the SVG source with explicit separators.

    FluentIcon<Role> keys hold the geometries; FluentIconTemplate draws a 20px one and FluentIcon16Template a 16px one
    in the inherited foreground. Playnite copies TextBlock icon resources (menus, sidebar items) by glyph, font and
    foreground only, so those stay icofont glyphs; Sidebar Library and Statistics get Fluent icons through
    CustomControls/SidebarItem.xaml.
-->
